{"strongs": "H3059", "word": "יְהוֺאָחָז", "translit": "ye.ho.a.chaz", "root": "הוד", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "hath grasped", "definition": "יְהוֺאָחָז , יְוֺאָחָז proper name, masculine ( ׳ י hath grasped ; ᵐ5 Ἰωαχας , & Ἰωαχαζ ; compare also אֲהַזְיָהוּ , & cuneiform Ia-u-—a-zi for Ahaz, see אָחָז , and compare further Jäger BAS i. 467 f. ) — 1. יְהוֺאָהָז king of Judah, son of Josiah 2Kgs 23:30 ; 2Kgs 23:31 ; 2Kgs 23:34 ; 2Chr 36:1 , = יוֺאָהָז v 2Chr 36:2 v 2Chr 36:4 (apparently = יוֺהָנָן 1Chr 3:15 ). 2. יְהוֺאָחָז king of Israel, son of Jehu 2Kgs 10:35 ; 2Kgs 13:1 ; 2Kgs 13:4 ; 2Kgs 13:7 ; 2Kgs 13:8 ; 2Kgs 13:9 ; 2Kgs 13:10 ; 2Kgs 13:22 ; 2Kgs 13:25 (twice in verse); 2Kgs 14:8 ; 2Kgs 14:17 ; 2Chr 25:17 ; 2Chr 25:25 = יוֺאָחָז 2Kgs 14:1 . 3. יְהוֺאָחָז king of Judah, son of Jehoram of Judah 2Chr 21:17 ; 2Chr 25:23 = אֲחַזְיָהוּ ( אֲחַזְיָה ) 2 , q. v. 4. יוֺאָחָז father of יוֺאָח Josiah's chronicler 2Chr 34:8 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2103')\">BDB2103</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3059')\">H3059</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3099')\">H3099</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2102')\">BDB2102</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2104')\">BDB2104</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יְהוֺאָחָז</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יְוֺאָחָז</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <highlight>hath grasped</highlight>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἰωαχας</grk>, &amp; <grk>Ἰωαχαζ</grk>; compare also <bdbheb>אֲהַזְיָהוּ</bdbheb>, &amp; cuneiform <transliteration><highlight>Ia-u-—a-zi</highlight></transliteration> for Ahaz, see  <bdbheb><reflink>אָחָז</reflink></bdbheb>, and compare further Jäger<sup>BAS i. 467 f.</sup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <bdbheb>יְהוֺאָהָז</bdbheb> king of Judah, son of Josiah <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:30\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"30\"